msgstr "付喪神失物招領與物權仲裁處"

#. copy/propertyLead
#: src/js/commons.js:50
msgctxt "tree:copy#/propertyLead"
msgid ""
"Choose an item and describe your claim. Receipts, wear, previous holders, "
"and the object's own account all enter the hearing."
msgstr "選擇物品並說明申領理由。收據、磨損、前持有人與物品自己的證詞，都會列入聽證。"

