msgstr "我已讀過物件陳述，不會把它當作沒有意見的附件"

#. copy/acceptConditions
#: src/js/commons.js:50
msgctxt "tree:copy#/acceptConditions"
msgid "I accept that return, custody, or autonomy may carry care and appeal conditions"
msgstr "我接受返還、保管或自主去向可能附帶照護與申訴條件"

