#: src/js/commons.js:50
msgctxt "tree:copy#/conditionsError"
msgid ""
"That destination requires follow-up conditions; otherwise choose further "
"hearing or protective hold."
msgstr "這個去向需要接受後續條件；否則只能追加聽證或留置保管。"

